=== w moves to the start of the next word
ref:    motion.txt *w*
quote:  "[count] words forward."
given:  foo |bar baz
keys:   w
expect: foo bar |baz
mode:   normal

=== 2w with a count
ref:    motion.txt *w*
quote:  "[count] words forward."
given:  |foo bar baz
keys:   2w
expect: foo bar |baz

=== w crosses a line break
ref:    motion.txt *w*
quote:  "[count] words forward."
given:
  foo |bar
  baz
keys:   w
expect:
  foo bar
  |baz
